        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n(1) The Commissioner of Food Safety shall, by order, appoint the Designated Officer,\nwho shall not be below the rank of a Sub-Divisional Officer, to be in-charge of food safety administration in such area as may be specified by regulations"
      },
      {
